    <item>
      <title>Dialektik 0.3.0</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>Dialektik 0.3.0</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Finalized the Flutter desktop pre-release with a Google Docs-first workspace.</li>
          <li>Separated Evidence Library from Offline Workspace.</li>
          <li>Improved desktop navigation, keyboard focus, panel sizing, and page spacing.</li>
          <li>Improved embedded Google Docs recovery and document-link management.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
